<title>USA: Wyandanch UFSD, N.Y. won by Prudential.</title>
<headline>Wyandanch UFSD, N.Y. won by Prudential.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prudential Securities, Inc., said it won $11.080 million   of Wyandanch Union Free Sch Dist, N.Y., school district</p>
<p>bonds, with a net interest cost of 5.5484 percent.</p>
</text>
